description:
This is a PR for #222 - providing schema definitions for response and request bodies

(Think also covers #819)

## PR task list:

Functional:
- [ ] Discuss design and make sure the maintainer is happy... 
- [ ] Discuss implementation and make sure the maintainer is happy... I think some names could be better (starting with `object`). I think there should be a way to do the object blocks without the empty function() {} calls? I think #763 might help make the block code less icky... You could look at more advanced scenarios too...
- [ ] I suspect the regexes "could be better"...
